-<p align="center" style=" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;"><span style=" font-family:'Viner Hand ITC'; font-size:20pt; color:#ffffff;">— Psalm 1:2–3</span></p>
